      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انزال</span></b>  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, removed;</i> or <i>made
to go away, pass away, depart, remove,</i> or <i>shift.</i>
(S, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انزال عَنْهُ</span> <i>He became separated
from him.</i> (K.) [See also 7 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زيل</span>.]

